  "description": "Pure-managed QOI (\"Quite OK Image\") decoder and encoder for .NET, written from the QOI specification. Decodes RGB and RGBA images straight into a caller's buffer in any 8-bit layout with no allocation; encodes from RGBA, BGRA, RGB, BGR or grey, to an array or a stream. AOT-compatible.",
